    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tile Blocks is a building game</strong> where you'll challenge your ingenuity by placing objects from your inventory to help Clampy reach his destination. Each object has a unique functionality, so you'll need to use them wisely to complete the level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Prepare the Scenario</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Creation Mode</strong>, you'll use your inventory to place objects. While in this mode, the scenario will remain static. You'll have a wide variety of objects at your disposal: Boxes, bombs, trampolines, levers, and many more. Use them wisely, as you'll only have a limited amount per level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6\ufe0f Test if it Works</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you're finished, press <strong>Play</strong>, and the scenario will come to life. It's time for Clampy to attempt to reach the goal! If it fails, don't worry\u2014you can always make adjustments to the objects and try again.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tile Blocks is a building game</strong> where you'll challenge your ingenuity by placing objects from your inventory to help Clampy reach his destination. Each object has a unique functionality, so you'll need to use them wisely to complete the level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Prepare the Scenario</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Creation Mode</strong>, you'll use your inventory to place objects. While in this mode, the scenario will remain static. You'll have a wide variety of objects at your disposal: Boxes, bombs, trampolines, levers, and many more. Use them wisely, as you'll only have a limited amount per level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6\ufe0f Test if it Works</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you're finished, press <strong>Play</strong>, and the scenario will come to life. It's time for Clampy to attempt to reach the goal! If it fails, don't worry\u2014you can always make adjustments to the objects and try again.</p>",
